    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42254" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρεείνω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρέω</span> A) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ask,
